## Quick start

```bash
just install
just ci
```

{% if stage == "explore" %}
`just ci` runs `test`, the one recipe the `explore` stage asks for. Until the project writes it in the justfile, it
fails with "not configured".
{% else %}
`just ci` runs the `lint`, `test` and `audit` recipes. Until the project writes them in the justfile, each fails with
"not configured".
{% endif %}
{% if stack_decided %}
CI runs `just ci` on every pull request.
{% else %}
CI starts running `just ci` once the stack is decided (`.claude/CLAUDE.md` § Stack).
{% endif %}

